serverless, we set out to build the future of vector databases, and what we have created is an entirely novel solution to the problem of knowledge in the AI era. This article will describe why and how we rebuilt Pinecone, the results of more than a year of active development, and ultimately, what we see as the future of vector databases.\\n\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.pinecone.io/blog/serverless-architecture/\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"5\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"href\":\"https://www.pinecone.io/blog/serverless-architecture/md/\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Reimagining the vector database to enable knowledgeable AI | Pinecone\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"With Pinecone serverless, we set out to build the future of vector databases, and what we have created is an entirely novel solution to the problem of knowledge in the AI era. This article will describe why and how we rebuilt Pinecone, the results of more than a year of active development, and ultimately, what we see as the future of vector databases.\\n\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.pinecone.io/api/og/?title=Reimagining%20the%20vector%20database%20to%20enable%20knowledgeable%20AI\u0026category=Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:site\",\"content\":\"@pinecone\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:creator\",\"content\":\"@pinecone\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Reimagining the vector database to enable knowledgeable AI\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"With Pinecone serverless, we set out to build the future of vector databases, and what we have created is an entirely novel solution to the problem of knowledge in the AI era. This artic